{% import "components/lightbox-gallery.njk" as lightboxC %}
{% if imageGalleryDemo.source == "pexels" %}
<p>Six real photos fetched live from Pexels, each resized to two widths and encoded as WebP and JPEG, laid out in a plain CSS grid:</p>
{% else %}
<p>Pexels photos weren't available for this build (usually a missing <code>PEXELS_API_KEY</code>), so these are the local placeholder gradients. They go through exactly the same pipeline: resized to two widths, encoded as WebP and JPEG, laid out in a plain CSS grid:</p>
{% endif %}
<div class="image-gallery" data-lightbox-gallery>
  {% for item in imageGalleryDemo.items %}
  {{ lightboxC.lightboxItem(item, "image-gallery__item") }}
  {% endfor %}
</div>
